  (property "Footprint" "" (at 121.92 81.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
  (property "Datasheet" "~" (at 121.92 81.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
  (pin "1" (uuid "60ef69d2-c880-4544-9ba3-6d8bf3af53d0"))
  (instances (project "rpi5datv-tuner-link" (path "/fa3b75d9-517b-4947-ac8a-f8d83dabb9a9" (reference "#PWR05") (unit 1)))))
(text "GPIO12 is header pin 32, GND is pin 34 (30 / 39 also GND)." (at 25.4 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9d2351cd-abe2-4198-b6a6-58c9223efb00"))
(text "R1 + R2/R3/R4: protects the GPIO and gives a ~10 dB, 50 ohm pad. Bridge R3 and leave out R2/R4 for 10 dB more signal." (at 25.4 44.45 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e3f4ee9e-2997-42a7-be06-e6186c3c185d"))
(text "L1 + C1: high-pass, knocks the strong low-frequency DDS tone down ~30 dB; passes 400 MHz - 2 GHz. L1: 4 turns of 0.5 mm wire on a 3 mm drill." (at 25.4 48.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f3ed9f5c-3ead-42d5-adf8-32fdcf75efbb"))
(text "C1 is ALSO the DC block: a satellite receiver puts 13/18 V on the cable. Rate it >= 50 V. Turn LNB power OFF in the receiver anyway." (at 25.4 52.07 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1348838c-1749-46a0-ae8a-6d627649421d"))
(text "Build it small: leads under 5 mm, inside an F-connector or a tin box, coax from there to the receiver." (at 25.4 55.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "79758964-2006-47cc-b8d0-8b81834e2f17"))
(text "Expected level at the receiver: about -30 dBm on 437 MHz, about -40 dBm on 1050 MHz (rough estimate, unmeasured)." (at 25.4 59.69 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "baf29f8f-58f3-47c1-af77-6883e2c151f8"))
(text "Satellite receiver (950-2150 MHz IF):  rpi5datv -t -f 1050 -s 2000 -c 1/2  ->  receiver: LNB LO 9750, transponder 10800 MHz, SR 2000, FEC 1/2, LNB power off." (at 25.4 100.33 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0c596668-de5c-46cc-a9bd-9cd30fa8a284"))
(text "RTL-SDR + leandvb, MiniTiouner/Ryde: same circuit, 437 MHz directly (rpi5datv -t -f 437 -s 333). A DVB-T/T2 TV tuner can NOT decode DVB-S." (at 25.4 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4d1ed20a-d7ba-4c91-81fa-aec0164c5dc0"))
(text "DO NOT radiate: this is for a cable into the receiver only. Without the band-pass filter + licence it must not go to an antenna." (at 25.4 107.95 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4ad84153-9fb7-43d3-8c18-c6c3e04fbc80"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
